   Dubrovinsky, L. S., Univ Bayreuth, Bayer Geoinst, D-95440 Bayreuth, Germany.
   Cerantola, V; Chumakov, A., I, European Synchrotron Radiat Facil, BP 220, F-38043 Grenoble, France.},
DOI = {10.1038/s41598-019-41184-3},
Article-Number = {4464},
