   Li, XY (Corresponding Author), Univ Chinese Acad Sci, Beijing 100049, Peoples R China.
   Cheng, Peng; Li, Xuyong; Su, Jingjun; Hao, Shaonan, Chinese Acad Sci, State Key Lab Urban \& Reg Ecol, Res Ctr Ecoenvironm Sci, Shuangqing Rd 18, Beijing 100085, Peoples R China.
